{
  "authority_effect": "NONE",
  "evidence_effect": "NONE",
  "chapter": 85,
  "title": "丧仪渐歇深闺愈静　沉痼日侵弱质难支",
  "title_status": "TG工作回目",
  "source": {
    "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
    "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
    "lines": [
      342,
      400
    ],
    "byte_range": [
      12779,
      15294
    ],
    "text_sha256": "3bd89b623481c533e101c5415599c7fb57a5cc111e41393c7d6557867c06997b"
  },
  "card_fields": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "name": "硬节点",
      "text": "**1｜硬节点**  \nR10/R11：黛玉必须沉痼日深、泪尽夭亡；不许新造急性绝症。H03丧期仍在。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          347,
          349
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          12899,
          13018
        ],
        "text_sha256": "17beb24734fa25cc7e24030b3834670b9fb35170e2cce1c3bc140233aa57fb42"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "name": "最强处",
      "text": "**2｜最强处**  \n紫鹃起居纸、雪雁“药铺账”笑话、睡眠/饭/药连续记录；黛玉仍有笑与嫌闷；“明日看旧集”的普通明日感。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          350,
          352
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          13018,
          13186
        ],
        "text_sha256": "b70ac5c7f04638768c39964dab0f0437f34cb61c1e8790859d2ec47a3db82e9e"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "name": "最薄处",
      "text": "**3｜最薄处**  \nA01《十独吟》需要在本回建立完整容器；病情“偶有好转假象”与作品完成要协调，不得像临终冲刺。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          353,
          355
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          13186,
          13343
        ],
        "text_sha256": "adf55bd62accec7a630c747be806342c2ba318635dfc81fd6cc2670eb95e2bfe"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "name": "缺失情节",
      "text": "**4｜缺失情节**  \n85-S1五项起居指标持续；S2宝玉探视从随意改为先问；S3宝钗现实照料增加但不宣布角色；A01在数日旧稿基础上整理成组。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          356,
          358
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          13343,
          13527
        ],
        "text_sha256": "d68dd761d9a2da09f2ac251150f90296ce3a2676152c0b221d1799f24032b9b1"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "name": "人物",
      "text": "**5｜人物**  \n紫鹃、雪雁、宝玉、宝钗、医者；避免家族轮流“探病打卡”。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          359,
          361
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          13527,
          13630
        ],
        "text_sha256": "87ece390325808016f90b1668621d104ad9029ce34d0952f0ea5e829d453c3e3"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "name": "文化",
      "text": "**6｜文化**  \n病中阅读已充分；不补琴书消遣。A01是唯一大文学增量。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          362,
          364
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          13630,
          13724
        ],
        "text_sha256": "f0ffbe1635ad9acecedfb01de30dc2c5427ee33cac3f331f2748dd080bef744b"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "name": "诗文身份",
      "text": "**7｜诗文身份**  \nA01《十独吟》题名存在为硬证；**85显题仅为C-main，作者与具体形制继续OPEN**。当前正文只让题名稿件出现在黛玉旧书/旧纸环境中，不以此宣布作者。若后续要实体化作者、篇数或诗体，必须先更新实施事实登记再进入正文。G01普通未成小诗可在85出现，但86才最后停笔。C03《五美吟》只作结构远回声，不重引。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          365,
          367
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          13724,
          14160
        ],
        "text_sha256": "b5f180defda97694e82ca62745967f84fa6cfb0ecd0959efb74fd0e06ffeeb71"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "name": "笑料",
      "text": "**8｜笑料**  \n“听咳有功”“记账第一”等保持病中活声。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          368,
          370
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          14160,
          14239
        ],
        "text_sha256": "47dda190d17e7c75969a0a94f84759c274f1565761460541a2ce6ceb2f8497ec"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "name": "宗教/梦",
      "text": "**9｜宗教/梦**  \n低。黛玉不参禅、不梦警幻、不预言自己死期。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          371,
          373
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          14239,
          14325
        ],
        "text_sha256": "d8dd428c12b972554b90fbca22c5f4a1b06496fd25d1ce384c1c78f10e6e4cf7"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "name": "职业",
      "text": "**10｜职业**  \n大夫、药铺只继续长期病线；不诊断“新病”。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          374,
          376
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          14325,
          14408
        ],
        "text_sha256": "0fe2673355c12078abe02ad5ce87e2f155aff23d1a9dfd280efaff81a2d3d559"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "name": "四链",
      "text": "**11｜四链**  \n钱仍E0；药、食养、热水、夜守有人力；信息以起居纸替代“她今日看着好些”的主观判断。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          377,
          379
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          14408,
          14550
        ],
        "text_sha256": "e393a20adbc9fece6ab3ab5087356f8a5e78a2aacd3f716de3db4b1098e4dffb"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "name": "保留",
      "text": "**12｜保留**  \n睡眠记录、热水、窗纱、旧集、紫鹃夜守、日常玩笑。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          380,
          382
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          14550,
          14642
        ],
        "text_sha256": "7173a63f79af94b2190e58ff8f1fa80fab5df23a5b968969c291b256ccc90631"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "name": "应删",
      "text": "**13｜应删**  \n“这是她最后一部作品”式作者标注；《十独吟》直接十首全读若压垮病日节奏，需要分段呈现。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          383,
          385
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          14642,
          14791
        ],
        "text_sha256": "ee604a11d1d6b35565534f2b17faf6cf2ee80ff06d5cb09871315b3ef5f2f685"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "name": "L3候选",
      "text": "**14｜L3候选**  \nA01插入位置可做局部结构重排，但不得把整回变诗社回。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          386,
          388
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          14791,
          14888
        ],
        "text_sha256": "c456752a520c1a587247bb64c6885b4730951b608aa9a8459f930483777f2efd"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "name": "前80同构",
      "text": "**15｜前80同构**  \n45风雨词、64五美吟：病/悲情中写作仍是人物行动。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
